html.p:
Read it top to bottom: the counters give the big picture; Detections lists everything the 12 transparent rules flagged;
        What is normal shows each device's usual behaviour; Is the separation working shows what the firewall stopped;
        Do the devices still work shows the controllers reaching them; Data quality shows what the evidence covers.
        Grey dashed markers on the time charts are the operator's notes (what was done, when).
